|------|---------|
| **MarkdownViewer.vue** | • Added `menuComponents` tracking object<br>• Modified `wrapHeadingsWithMenu()` to place wrapper AFTER heading<br>• Rewrote `attachHeadingListeners()` to mount actual HeadingActionMenu component instances<br>• Proper event delegation via `$on` |
| **HeadingActionMenu.vue** | • Improved positioning (absolute right)<br>• Better pointer-events handling for nested dropdowns<br>• Wider dropdown menu (w-56) |
| **ChatEntry.vue** | • Added "create-chat" action to `chapterActions` array<br>• Added handler `createChatFromChapter()` method<br>• Added listener case for `create-chat` actionId<br>• Emits `create-chat` event up to parent container |

This approach makes heading actions **fully dynamic** — any container can pass different actions without modifying the markdown viewer itself.

